 ( { b) while after } 2. Kd6 Ra6 ( { b1) not } 2. Rd7 Kf6 $2 3. Rf8 Kg7 4. e7 ) 
3. Ke5 Ra5 4. Rd5 Ra8 $1 { White can't make progress; e. g. } 5. Rb5 Kg6 6. Rb7 ( { b2) or } 6. Kd6 Kf6 { followed by side checks; } ) 
