3. Rd6 $1 { An astute try. } ( { a) After } 3. Kd6 Kf8 ( { a1) or } 3. Rd6 Kf6 4. Rf7 Kg6 5. Rf1 Ra6 $1 { followed by more side checks; } ) 
4. e7 Ke8 5. Ke6 Ra6 6. Rd6 Ra8 { Black holds more comfortably. } ) 
