Ke7 $1 ( { Also possible is } 1... Rh4 { cutting off White's king along the 4th rank, for example } 2. c6 Ke7 $1 3. Rd7 Ke8 { when White is unable to progress. In fact, in the later chapter about cutting the king off, we will come across an almost identical situation in the example Gashimov - Jakovenko } ) 
