21. Kd4 Kh3 { With the white king unable to step on the c-file due to the check on c8, Black just waits. } 22. Ke5 Rb4 23. Kd6 Rb6+ ( { There was nothing wrong with } 23... Rb8 24. Kc7 Rb4 25. Kc6 Rb8 { , but the text is more direct. } ) 
24. Kc5 Rg6 $1 25. b4 ( { Draw, in view of } 25. b4 Rxg3 26. Rxg3 Kxg3 27. b5 h4 { etc. } ) 

 1/2-1/2

