 { Finally, let's see three examples where the rook switched its angle with great success. } 1... { -KEY- } g2 $1 { The prelude to a surprising mating attack. } ( { In contrast, the game went } 1... Rg2 $2 2. Kf1 Rh2 3. Kg1 { and a draw was soon agreed. } ) 
2. d7 { There is nothing better. } Rb8 $1 ( { Black wins - 'Chess Today'; e.g. } 2... Rb8 2. f6 Rh8 { with the inevitable threat of ...Rh1+. } ) 
 ( { or } 2... Rb8 2. Re8 Rb1 ) 

